WEBVTT

1
00:00:04.608 --> 00:00:10.509
Uppfæra námskeiða- og stofulista:
what the survey page offers.

2
00:00:15.613 --> 00:00:23.188
Sækja athugasemdir kennara fetches
the answers.

3
00:00:23.288 --> 00:00:28.407
New answers land in “athugasemdir”,
not yet dealt with.

4
00:00:28.507 --> 00:00:34.804
In Tímabókanir, this filter finds
courses with open answers.

5
00:00:34.904 --> 00:00:41.442
The teacher's tab is marked.

6
00:00:41.542 --> 00:00:47.444
The answer: times, rooms and who
teaches what. Fylla út úr könnun.

7
00:00:47.544 --> 00:00:53.446
Each teacher goes on the sessions
of the types they teach.

8
00:00:53.546 --> 00:00:59.448
Kennir líka: a type the course has
no session of yet – and noted.

9
00:00:59.548 --> 00:01:03.718
Check it, and change it
if needed.

10
00:01:03.818 --> 00:01:09.720
A reply drafted from all this –
Svara í tölvupósti opens your email.

11
00:01:09.820 --> 00:01:15.152
Afgreiða athugasemdir: saved,
and the answer is closed.

12
00:01:15.252 --> 00:01:21.586
In the session: the teacher's red
and green, N-132 as a last resort.
